         Σ_{k<=Y}(1 − k/Y)s_k cos kx >= −K/2 − ½.
     Proof: S(x) = (1/(2q))Σ_γ λ_γ F_Y(x + 2πγ/q) − s_0/2 with Fejér F_Y >= 0, and Σ_γ F_Y(x + 2πγ/q) = q when Y < q;
