     (1 + K)^k − 1 against q. So order-k information survives a weak limit only for K = o(q^{1/k}).
   - At order 2 (K = o(√q)), the limit objects at half density are consistent: p ≡ ½ (R12-H). Order 3 would need
     K = o(q^{1/3}), Sanders' range.
