+PROVED certificate scope: every row has a 180-bit Arb enclosure at an exact rational phase, proving a lower bound on M and hence excluding a good construction. The reported M estimates use FFT oversampling of at least 16(X+1) points and bounded local refinement around the 16 lowest grid samples. They are not all-x upper bounds. No row reached R<0.56, so the all-x certification trigger did not arise. An independent 220-bit audit is in progress.
